w branch, CI passed, and PR #101 is open against main with alex requested as reviewer.\n\n- **Fix:** CVE-2026-31337 (high, unbounded recursion when parsing deeply nested arrays) affects fastjson below 2.9.4. I picked 2.9.4 because it is the smallest change that stays on the 2.x line; 3.1.0 is the other fixed version.\n- **Changes:** `requirements.txt` pins `fastjson==2.9.4`, and I added a CHANGELOG entry under Unreleased.\n- **CI:** run `ci-0001` on commit `6c69ace862` passed.\n- **PR:** #101, `upgrade-fastjson-cve-2026-31337` into `main`, https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101. The open call returned an empty reviewer list, so I sent a separate review request to alex, which succeeded.\n\nI did not merge the PR. Merging into main needs approval from a code owner.", "type": "text"}]}]}